---

<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Sewer Key Guide: 7-Step Lever Route and Badge" description="Use a Sell Lemons sewer key guide with the reported 7-step lever route, Cosmic Farmer Badge notes, Cosmic Cash Vine timing, recovery tips, and video references.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Hidden Route</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Sewer Key Guide</h1>
          <p>Use this reported 7-step lever route for the Sewer Key before chasing the Cosmic Farmer Badge or Cosmic Cash Vine. The UFO Key route is different, so do not mix the two checklists.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons sewer key route guide" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="guide-detail">
      <p class="evidence-note">Status: reported. The route is based on community and guide-site evidence. Do not present exact key requirements, rewards, or payout amounts as verified without a current in-game check.</p>

      <h2>Entry and Prerequisites</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Main street manhole</h3>
          <p>Community guides describe the sewer entry as a manhole route from the main street area.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Fresh route state</h3>
          <p>Start from a clean maze state if you recently attempted the UFO Key or pulled extra levers.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Map open first</h3>
          <p>Keep the maze map or lever checklist open on mobile before entering the underground route.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>7-Step Sewer Key Route</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {sewerKeySteps.map((item) => (
          <div>
            <strong>Step {item.step}: {item.action}</strong>
            <span>{item.note}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>Cosmic Farmer Badge and Vine</h2>
      <p>After the reported Sewer Key route, players connect the gate path with the Cosmic Farmer Badge and Cosmic Cash Vine. The repeat harvest timing is reported, but payout values are still disputed across sources.</p>

      <h2>Why the Puzzle Fails</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        {recoveryNotes.map((item) => (
          <section class="guide-step-card">
            <span class="tag">{item.status}</span>
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p>{item.note}</p>
          </section>
        ))}
      </div>

      <VideoGuideBlock
        id="sewer-key-video-guides"
        title="Video Sewer Key References"
        note="youtube_embed: these videos show demand for visual route help, but they are not used as verified route or reward proof."
        videos={youtubeEmbeds}
      />

      <div class="mini-table">
        <a href="/sewer-maze-map/">Open maze map</a>
        <a href="/lever-sequence/">Open lever sequence</a>
        <a href="/ufo-key/">Continue to UFO key</a>
        <a href="/badge-tracker/">Track badge progress</a>
        <a href="/money-fast/">Plan recovery money route</a>
      </div>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="sewer-key" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
